_5509969863082992813_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-qGF97e3YuwQ7kNvwFKT8yF&_nc_oc=Adqzft20gKQdZDrsulNOhEmJsvZIYLM_i1Xlqv5pyJgnSYNDVoUcZMYnoPi1IDUq19g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpQvnT4CnXaIca84FlMqfaJlGtuVYWoSirV_eYvkdZhw&oe=6AF72B89"}, "display_name": "Light Up The Dark", "keywords": [], "long_description": "*  Dual Controller or Dual Hand/Finger control operation.\n*  Seamlessly switch between hands and controllers (with a hardware delay).\n*  Play reclined or laying down!  Or upside down.  Any position, any space.\n*  Environmental features such as snow, falling leaves, fireflies, and bubbles.  Seriously, try the bubbles.\n*  Listen to various audio tracks including a gentle Mozart piece, a Sousa March, and Wagner's Ride of the Valkyries, adjustable volumes for music and fireworks.\n*  Set the weather and the Speed of Time.  Note, the weather has a mind of its own.  \n*  Show and hide individual UI components or enter the VOID, with all aim assistance turned off.", "short_description": "Light Up The Dark is an exciting firework experience featuring a highly customizable atmosphere and fun casual modes and a snowman shooting game.  Advanced controls using fingers and hands provide a unique experience.\n\nEnjoy a zen world with a light snow and the sounds of the forest at night, with fireworks.  \n\n\u200bOr bend time so a day lasts a few seconds, with a Sousa march fillings your ears while snowmen crash any sense of tranquility, with fireworks.\n\nYour fireworks.  Your way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lightupthedarkgame.com/credits-legal", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Destroy Technology", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.LightUpTheDarkGame.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "contex